WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.730
This girl is Kouyama Mitsuki.

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.270
She's twelve and dreams of becoming a singer.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.810
But, unfortunately...

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.550
...she only has one year left to live.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:11.440
We, the Shinigami were asked to keep an 
eye on her until the inevitable fate, but...

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:14.550
Today, she became an adult...

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.490
...and she performed incredibly at the audition.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:17.160
Aren't we...

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.990
...changing her destiny?!

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.210
Well, then...

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.920
...I wonder what's going to happen today.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:23.530
Huh?

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.750
Do you understand.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:29.620
Yes.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:12.110
Um...

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:13.140
...I'm home.

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:20.140
What gives!

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.960
She really has no manners!

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:27.410
I'll make a bunch of rice cakes for you then.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:28.910
Which do you like better, red beans or soy beans?

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.200
But we're out of tea...

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:33.180
O-Oh... Mitsuki-chan's back home.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.000
Yes.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.290
I'll put her on.

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:37.240
Hello?

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:40.420
She finally put you on.

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:44.300
I thought that I would have to talk to Tanaka-san forever.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.230
Wakaouji-sensei!

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.890
Why are you calling me?

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:49.960
Ah... well...

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.000
Actually...

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.270
The person who's going to be 
your manager has come to see you.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:55.100
Eh!

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.350
Manager?!

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.840
Keep your voice down!

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.560
Someone's listening...

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:05.900
Why'd the manager go to your place?

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:07.280
That's because...

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:10.560
...I've become your guardian.

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.560
And I just talked with her a moment ago.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:14.240
So then...

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:19.240
The manager said that she was going 
to come to visit you and me, but...

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:22.880
Mitsuki-chan, could you come 
to the hospital right now?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:24.000
Of course!

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.420
I'll be right there!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.490
If it's to see Dr. Wakaouji...

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:40.850
...he's coming on a house call tomorrow, right?

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:42.280
Yes, but...

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:45.070
...I want to go right now.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.440
Um...

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:48.490
I have to go shopping, so...

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:51.240
...shall I take Mitsuki-san to the hospital?

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:54.850
That is acceptable.

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:56.230
Please take care of it.

00:03:58.390 --> 00:04:00.370
My eyes, Meroko!

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:01.330
No way!

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:03.710
Mitsuki-chan's still changing!

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.590
It's okay now.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:10.090
Besides, what's the point of changing?

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:12.970
She can't meet the manager in that body.

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:13.380
Ah...

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:14.660
That's right!

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.930
Then, after we get to the hospital...

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.850
...transform me into a sixteen year old, okay Takuto?

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:22.120
Wait a minute.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.830
That'll be fine for the manager...

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:28.490
...but she's going to be with her guardian, Dr. Wakaouji, right?

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:30.150
Won't she?

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:34.370
What will the Doctor think if he sees Mitsuki as a sixteen year old?

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:37.470
What do we do...?!

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:38.980
What do we do?

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.060
Well...

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.250
At times like this...

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.540
The Shinigami Handbook...

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.920
Let's see... let's see...

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.800
...we'll have to tell them everything!

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.760
These are the two are the Shinigami...

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:53.180
...Takuto and Meroko!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.180
Takuto turned my twelve year old body...

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.060
...to one of a sixteen year old!

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:59.930
And when I'm like that, I don't have any cancer in my throat!

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:02.230
I can sing with all of my heart!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.330
Really? That's how it is?

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.610
I don't have a problem with it!

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:08.570
Okay.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.480
It's not okay!

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:12.380
Doing something as strange as that...

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:13.530
...is totally out of the question!

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:14.990
Geez!

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.730
Let's see...

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:17.790
Meroko...

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.300
Is that handbook even useful at all?

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.680
I get it!

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:25.700
I'll give you a rare chance to see my power!

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.300
Oh? You're gonna show me?

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.510
So then, what's your plan?

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.570
W-Well, that's...

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:33.840
Tell the manager...

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.000
Um...

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.930
It's her little sister, Mikazuki!

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:38.930
Or something like that...

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:40.470
The details aren't important!

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:43.990
Won't that Wakaouji guy think it's weird?

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:45.220
Like I said...

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:50.080
Mikazuki is... her modeling stage name...

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.110
That's it!

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:52.470
Let's go then!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:55.140
Oh well, I guess we'll just have to try as hard as we can.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:55.780
Yeah.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.980
You have to try as hard as you can, too!

00:05:58.980 --> 00:05:59.700
Yes!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.120
Here we are.

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:11.800
Yeah.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.550
I wonder if I should go in with you.

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:15.180
Wait!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:17.340
If she does something like that, it'll be a proble-...!

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:19.760
Um... what'll be a problem?

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:20.260
Eh?

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:21.060
That's...

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:24.180
...I think that would be too much of a problem for you.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:27.060
Please take care of your shopping.

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:28.900
Then...

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.570
...I'll come to pick you up later.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.470
Please wait in the lobby, okay?

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:33.110
Okay!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.490
Meroko!

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:38.980
No more...

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:42.660
I'm sorry.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.990
It's fine.

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.960
Just remember that when I'm in that form...

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:47.500
...I can't take that much.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:48.420
Anyways...

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:50.310
...let's go inside.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:50.920
Okay.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.130
Really?

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:53.060
Oh?

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.340
She's here.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:55.640
Excuse me.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.140
Hey.

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:56.970
We've been waiting for you.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.920
This is your manager, Ooshige-san...

00:06:58.920 --> 00:06:59.920
...introduce yourself.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:03.310
Pleased to meet you.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:05.270
I'm Ooshige from Rage Pro.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.450
It's a woman, huh?

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:09.480
And this is...

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:09.730
Ah!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:11.690
P-Pleased to meet you.

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:12.900
I'm Kouyama Mitsuki.

00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:14.220
Stupid!

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.490
What are you saying...?!

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.160
Did you forget everything we said back in the house?!

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:18.780
Ah?

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:19.660
That's not what I meant!

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:21.800
I'm her little sister, Mikazuki!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:23.870
Um... that's...

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.050
That's it.

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:28.120
Mitsuki-chan, tell Dr. Wakaouji to step outside.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.580
Tell him that you're going to explain everything.

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:31.620
Okay.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.840
Sensei, can you come out for a bit?

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:36.010
I see.

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:38.220
Mikazuki is your stage name, huh?

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.340
That's right. That's right.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:41.720
Then, what about the little sister part?

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:43.970
That's...

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:45.310
Um...

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.350
That's it!

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:47.180
You...

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:51.060
...refer to yourself as little sister because it's a catchphrase within the company.

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:52.310
You're just starting out, right?

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:54.200
Eh... is that true?

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.570
It's not, but...

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.070
Just tell him that!

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:58.200
Ah, I see!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:03.030
It's a catchphrase to say I'm the little sister of someone in the company....

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:04.700
...since I'm just starting out.

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:05.910
So that's it!

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:06.750
But...

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:07.910
There's <i>still</i>  something else?

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.670
Hmm...

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:10.370
Hmm?

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:11.290
Oh well.

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.790
Hang in there, Mitsuki-chan.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:15.280
Eh?

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.590
The first experience is always the most important.

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:21.550
Now you need to properly greet the manager you'll be depending on from here on out.

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:23.580
Shall we head back?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.000
Man... sorry about that.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.770
She hadn't told me the whole story yet.

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:34.570
It's nothing.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:35.900
Please don't worry about it.

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.480
Let's start over.

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:40.400
She's Mikazuki-chan, a little sister.

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:41.860
I'm looking forward to working together.

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.290
Me too.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.840
So then...

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.980
Um... where's the person herself?

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:50.760
What person...?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:54.080
Um... l-let's see...

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:55.050
School!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.670
Say she's at school!

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.040
Are you sure that's going to work?

00:08:59.040 --> 00:08:59.920
It's fine!

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:00.800
Um...

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:01.880
She's at school!

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.650
Ah. So she's at school, huh?

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:04.620
Yeah...

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:07.310
She goes to school like she should.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.560
See.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.980
That took care of the two of them just fine.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.610
Well... it sure seems like it.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.050
What should we do now?

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:15.540
Shall we wait for her?

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:16.690
Wait... for who?

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:20.860
Say she'll be here very soon!

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.150
Um, um...

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:23.320
She'll be here very soon, so...

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.450
Really?

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:28.080
Then I'll have the guardian, Dr. Wakaouji...

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.830
...take a look at the arrangements for next time.

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:31.870
Oh, sure.

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.790
That was too close.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:36.540
Is it okay to just listen and watch like this?

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:40.350
Ooshige-san, there's something I want to ask you.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.620
What is it?

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:44.340
She's... going to be very busy from now on, isn't she?

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.520
Well...

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.760
You want me to contact the school?

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:48.810
Yeah...

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.470
That too...

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.230
There's that problem with your throat too, right?

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:56.760
That won't be an issue.

00:09:56.760 --> 00:10:00.030
Mitsuki-chan will be with people her age...

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:04.200
...they'll only be working after 
school and on weekends.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:07.200
It's a relief to hear that.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:12.040
The most important event 
remaining is her debut, then.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:16.750
Since she's a fresh new artist coming off auditions...

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:20.170
...it would be wise to act now.

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:21.210
Of course.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.800
For that reason...

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.590
...there are voice training and dance lessons...

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:29.640
...for her to receive instruction in as well as participate in.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.890
Hold on a minute.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:34.520
You said something about voice training...

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:35.520
Then...

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:38.360
...it's almost as if Mitsuki-chan is becoming a singer.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:39.840
Oh man...

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:41.320
He found a flaw in your story, didn't he?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.080
Sensei! Actually, that's...

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:43.740
Eh?

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:49.000
What are you going to do?

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:49.620
Um...

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.530
Um... well...

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:52.850
Not this!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.540
Hello?

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:56.960
Wait, what am I supposed to do with a phone?!

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:58.420
Phone?

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.210
Ah.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:00.880
Are you going to call her?

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.300
Ah... yes!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.260
You're going to do that!

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.630
An hour long conversation...!

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.470
W-Wait!

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:11.350
Just now, that was...

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.520
Free roll?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.980
Ah...

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.200
Ah...

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.200
For some reason, I have no idea what's going on...

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:31.870
Don't sound like it doesn't concern you.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.160
This isn't a simple matter.

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:35.600
The manager, Ooshige-san...

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:39.500
...thinks that she's Mitsuki-chan's little sister, Mikazuki.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:45.800
Dr. Wakaouji thinks that Mitsuki-chan is
just using Mikazuki as a stage name.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.130
That much I can explain.

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:50.140
But if Wakaouji-sensei...

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.170
...finds out that I've become a singer...

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:56.790
You can't settle everything just like that.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:59.600
If only there was some way we could do all of this over...

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:05.610
As I thought, it'd be best to tell Wakaouji-sensei the truth.

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:06.660
No way.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.780
Telling him something like this so suddenly...

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:10.880
There's no way he'll believe it.

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:11.770
Yeah!

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:15.450
You're the only human that can see Meroko and me.

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:16.450
That's right.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:20.830
He'd never believe you about us Shinigami.

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:22.380
But...

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.840
If I can't get him to believe it...

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.800
You're such a helpless kid.

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:33.840
Mero-Mero Change!

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:44.150
How's this?

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.010
There's two of me...

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.290
"How's this...?"

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:48.570
Meroko, you...

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:49.530
If I'm like this...

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.110
...I'll be able to do something.

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:53.180
The ones who silence the tears of children...

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:54.240
Shinigami Duo!

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:58.250
Spring Onion Ramen's leader is going to 
show you just what she can do!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.840
Sensei!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.000
Mitsuki-chan!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:03.930
I was worried.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:05.040
Where did you run off too?

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:05.880
Sorry!

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:06.630
I...

00:13:06.630 --> 00:13:08.840
...was feeling a little sick.

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:12.120
Do you want to lie down somewhere then?

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.010
Nope!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.430
I'm totally fine now!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.430
Really? I guess it's okay then.

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:18.890
Her voice is kinda off...

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:20.430
Geez...

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:22.560
Her personality's wrong too...

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:23.350
No way, no way!

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:24.610
It's just your imagination! Your imagination!

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:26.940
By the way, Mitsuki-chan...

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:27.460
Yes?

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.650
About what that Ooshige-san said...

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:31.530
...for some reason, I don't understand it.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.780
What are you talking about?

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.000
After I heard what she had to say...

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:37.490
...it sounded like you were going to become a singer.

00:13:37.990 --> 00:13:39.600
That's because...

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:40.450
That's right!

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.330
A commercial!

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.920
She was talking about a commercial!

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:43.930
Really?!

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:44.570
Yep.

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:45.530
In it...

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:48.340
...a girl debuts as a singer!

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.340
Come! Come!

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:49.960
Hurry!

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:51.340
Let's go back to where Ooshige-san is.

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:53.160
We still have things to discuss, don't we?

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.890
Ah... yeah... I guess so.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:58.600
She's really something else, 
babbling on and on like that...

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.880
It feels like something is going to go wrong.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.690
I convinced him, didn't I?

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:09.560
What part of his face shows that he's convinced?

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:11.110
If that's the case, I still have a trick up my sleeve!

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:11.840
Ah!

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:13.350
Wakaouji-sensei, over there!

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:14.030
Eh? What?

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:14.780
Whoa!

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:16.370
It looks like an emergency!

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:17.320
Let's hurry!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.080
E-Emergency? Wait!

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:20.750
Eh?

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.200
W-Wait!

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:27.920
Now that the Doctor isn't around...

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:30.000
Mero-Mero Change!

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:37.090
How's this?

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:39.110
Meroko... again?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.140
For now...

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.810
...I'll go take care of the manager.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.810
I mean... I'll go take care of her.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:47.100
Nobody talks like that nowadays.

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:50.780
Well, you're pretty good at manipulating others.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.660
I... no, I mean...

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.200
Is there something wrong with me?

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.830
No... where is that girl?

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:04.790
Ah...

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:07.580
She's feeling a bit under the weather...

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:08.170
Huh?

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:11.630
She'll feel much better after resting, though.

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.130
Ah... is that so..?

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:15.430
Your talking still sound weird.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.630
I know that.

00:15:16.630 --> 00:15:18.260
Anyways, Ooshige-san...

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:18.800
Yes?

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:20.610
I've decided!

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:22.180
I'm going to put my faith in you...

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:24.310
...and leave everything to do with Mitsuki to you.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.770
I'm honored...

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:28.580
So...

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.610
...how are you going to explain this?

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:31.760
That's...

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:38.200
Yes. This is Wakaouji.

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:39.280
Yes.

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:41.030
Ah. I understand.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.790
Ooshige-san.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.830
There seem to be visitors for you in the parking lot.

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:46.710
For me?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:50.000
I wonder who it could be...

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.010
Again?

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.190
If we make it through this...

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:00.930
...that should take care of everything.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.940
This is exhausting, though.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:03.600
Ah...

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:08.520
I guess that...

00:16:08.520 --> 00:16:10.960
...I can't just leave it up to them...

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:13.120
I have to go tell the truth!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.850
Man... Mitsuki-chan.

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:15.380
Ah!

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:19.360
There wasn't an emergency at all.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:21.240
Wa-Wakaouji-sensei!

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:22.660
What is it this time?

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:23.910
Did something happen...

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:25.910
...or are you just crying <i>wolf</i> ?

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:27.750
That's not it!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.340
It wasn't a wolf!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.080
Um...

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.210
They call themselves Spring Onion Ramen!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:35.090
You really should just stop joking around.

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:36.340
Like I said...

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:39.380
...they're Shinigami who call themselves Spring Onion Ramen...

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:42.000
What are the two of you doing out here?

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.350
Come in, come in.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:52.130
You should leave this up to Meroko.

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.350
Dr. Wakaouji.

00:16:57.350 --> 00:16:58.110
Yes?

00:16:58.110 --> 00:17:00.000
Mitsuki-chan is amazing!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.280
Ah... not <i>that </i> much...

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:03.500
Well, anyways...

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.050
...I think she's a great girl who's full of talent.

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:07.200
R-Really?

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.580
Please!

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:09.830
Put your faith in me!

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:12.040
Leave Mitsuki-chan to me!

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.500
O-Okay.

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:18.730
Ah... what a bother.

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.930
There weren't any visitors here to see me.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:30.000
What do you mean by visitors?

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.670
Because... you just said that...

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:33.400
I did?

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.430
A-Anyways...

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:38.600
From now on... Kouyama Mitsuki is depending on you!

00:17:39.550 --> 00:17:40.690
It's my pleasure.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:41.780
It's my pleasure.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:43.880
Okay!

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:48.700
I really want... Mitsuki-chan to do her best.

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:49.520
Eh?

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.210
Actually...

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:59.010
I can't give you the proper treatment,

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.220
but as your doctor...

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:05.310
...I plan on taking the place of your parents.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.510
Sensei...

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:11.250
Work hard, okay?

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.240
Wakaouji-sensei...

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.790
Mitsuki, come out for a sec.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.940
Are you okay, Meroko?

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.840
Going through this many transformations in one day...

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.730
It's a first for her.

00:18:39.730 --> 00:18:40.930
'Sup...

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.030
She's already reached her limit.

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:44.490
I'm just fine.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.510
Who should I transform into this time?

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:48.840
Ah! Takuto is good.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:53.130
Um... Dr. Wakaouji.

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:53.680
Yes?

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:57.490
Forgive me if I'm wrong, but...

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:00.410
...did you play keyboard for
Route L a long time ago?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.380
Eh... yeah.

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:05.760
Just as I thought... you're <i>the</i>  prince!

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.990
I'm a huge fan of yours!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:08.620
Is that so?

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:11.540
I'm really an incredible fan of yours!

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:12.520
Back then...

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:15.670
...at a studio somewhere...

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:19.760
...I also tried to be an idol.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:20.490
But unfortunately... I failed miserably.

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:22.670
But unfortunately... I failed miserably.

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:23.520
Oh. That's right.

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:24.630
Now that I finally have this chance...

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.260
...could you sign this?

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:26.550
Ah?

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:30.010
Does Mitsuki-chan have a cellphone?

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.870
Ah. Mikazuki-chan!

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:34.050
Ah. Yes?

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:36.370
Mitsuki-chan is still in high school, right?

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:37.230
Eh... yes.

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:38.660
Actually...

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:41.690
...I came today to give her a cellphone.

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.600
Without this, she can't get in touch, right?

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:45.520
Yeah...

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:46.700
That's right.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:47.290
Then...

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.730
...I'll be heading to the high school.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.720
Great timing.

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:55.750
Thanks, then.

00:19:56.510 --> 00:19:57.780
What are you going to do now?

00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:58.960
If she goes to the high school...

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.940
...Mitsuki won't be there.

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:02.720
Takuto! Please!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.420
Turn me into a sixteen year old!

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:07.680
I want to talk to her myself!

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.000
It can't be helped.

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:33.080
If I'm sixteen year old Kouyama Mitsuki...

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:35.950
...I'll be able to go introduce myself!

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:40.180
Ooshige-san!

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:43.700
Mitsuki-chan?

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:44.600
Yes.

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:46.760
I'm sorry for being late.

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:50.730
I heard from my little sister 
that you were coming here.

00:20:50.730 --> 00:20:51.690
Really?

00:20:51.690 --> 00:20:53.010
I'm glad we met.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:53.720
Yes!

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:55.230
Pleased to meet you.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.680
I'm Kouyama Mitsuki!

00:20:57.680 --> 00:20:58.910
Pleased to meet you.

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:01.150
I'm Ooshige Masami from Rage Pro.

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:07.760
You'll be very busy from now on, so...

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:09.110
...prepare yourself!

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.000
Eh?

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:10.610
Even if I said that...

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:12.690
...you're still a new artist, aren't you?

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:15.280
I'll have to take care of you in the beginning.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.410
Please take care of me!

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:19.340
Okay.

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:21.140
For now, let's work hard!

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:21.800
Okay!

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:08.940
That girl's debut has finally arrived.

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:09.850
The producer is...

00:23:09.850 --> 00:23:11.850
...super-famous... Takasu Kohei!

00:23:11.850 --> 00:23:13.580
Hmm... that's impressive.

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.210
But you know...

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:16.000
That girl doesn't like Takasu's songs...

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:18.240
...and she's writing her own songs.

00:23:18.240 --> 00:23:20.800
Can an amateur like her really
do something like songwriting?

00:23:20.800 --> 00:23:23.180
It's all right. Everything will
work out as long as I'm there.

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:24.120
That's wrong!

00:23:24.120 --> 00:23:25.420
Songwriting is...

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:27.420
...something you have to pour your soul into!

00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:29.880
Next time on Full Moon wo Sagashite:

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:31.330
The Feelings In Your Song.

00:23:31.330 --> 00:23:32.670
Look forward to it!
